%% TECH-017 Sending email
%% What sendMail does with a mail. Steps are labelled with requirement IDs.
flowchart TD
    A[A card calls sendMail with subject, heading and text] --> B{Valid address? R1}
    B -- no --> F[Failure, nothing sent]
    B -- yes --> C[Build the HTML and plain text in the layout, R0]
    C --> D{RESEND_API_KEY set?}
    D -- yes --> E[POST to the provider, R1]
    E -- ok --> OK[Success]
    E -- error or no answer --> F
    D -- no --> G{Local database file? R2}
    G -- yes --> H[Append to mail-outbox.jsonl] --> OK
    G -- no --> F
